'''Thirteen''' (サーティーン, ''Sātīn'', '''Thirteen''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Thirteen|"Knockback" Effects Up (Sm)|Sniper the Heavy|jpname=サーティーン}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Given how it only contains [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Heavy]], the name of this Combo is likely a reference to Golgo 13, the pro assassin and sniper from the [[wikipedia:Golgo 13|manga of the same name]]. The reference is even more apparent with the Japanese names of Sniper the Heavy (Negolgo) and Sniper the Deadeye (Negolgo 31).

